<title>FRANCE: Aerospatiale to launch Thaicom 3 April 16.</title>
<headline>Aerospatiale to launch Thaicom 3 April 16.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aerospatiale said on Monday that it will launch Thaicom 3, a telecommunications satellite for Shinawatra Satellite Public Limited Company (SSA) of Thailand on April 16.</p>
<p>The satellite will be launched aboard Ariane 4 V-95 by Arianespace from Kourou, French Guyana.</p>
<p>Thaicom's 3's 39 tranponders in C and Ku bands will provide different services including direct to home television and telecommunications.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
